  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> be a matrix of order <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>det</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>det</mi><mfenced close=\"\"><mrow><mo>det</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>adj</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>adj</mo><mfenced><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to _____.",
